udio-title font-normal tracking-display-tight text-ink`,children:e}),t&&(0,A.jsx)(`p`,{className:`max-w-[480px] text-studio-base text-std-muted`,children:t})]}),n&&(0,A.jsx)(`div`,{className:`shrink-0`,children:n})]}),(0,A.jsx)(`div`,{className:i?`p-0`:`px-6 pt-5 pb-6`,children:r})]})}function xD({variant:e=`outline`,size:t=`md`,className:n,type:r=`button`,...i}){return(0,A.jsx)(`button`,{type:r,className:pD(`studio-btn inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-1.75 whitespace-nowrap rounded-control border border-transparent font-sans font-medium transition-[background-color,color,border-color,opacity] duration-(--duration-fast) disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 motion-reduce:transition-none`,mD,hD[e],gD[t],n),...i})}function SD({tone:e=`neutral`,children:t,className:n}){return(0,A.jsx)(`span`,{className:pD(`studio-status-chip inline-flex h-5.5 items-center gap-1.25 whitespace-nowrap rounded-pill px-2.25 font-sans text-studio-xs font-semibold tracking-chip`,_D[e],n),children:t})}var CD=e=>`${gr}/report-${e}.webp`;function wD(e,t,n,r,i){return{url:i,thumb:CD(e),handle:t,metric:n,format:r}}var TD={cover:{clientName:`Yuzli`,reportSubtitle:`What short-form content wins in food scanning, and where Yuzli fits.`,clientContact:`Prepared for the Yuzli team`,reportDate:`July 2026`},exec:{execSummaryHeadline:`Food-scanner demand is creator-made, and <em>no brand owns it yet.</em>`,finding1:`The audience is creator-led: label-reading and UPF content clears seven figures (<strong>16.8M plays</strong> on one TikTok, <strong>7.1M</strong> on one Short) while scanner brands post to hundreds.`,finding2:`UGC scan-demo appears in active ads: Munchee took <strong>1.3M likes</strong> on one demo, Fig's top video is a user demo, and <strong>Trash Panda</strong> runs the same format as ads, 150+ days live.`,finding3:`Yuka owns trust (<strong>80M users</strong>, zero ads) but not social: 177 TikTok followers, sub-1K Shorts, and other brands pay to cite its score.`,execRecommendation:`Enter through creator-voiced content: <strong>scan-demo UGC, label-shock swaps, grocery-aisle POV</strong>. The habit exists at scale and no scanner brand owns the conversation.`},landscape:{landscapeHeadline:`Awareness went mainstream, <em>the content layer is still unclaimed.</em>`,landscapeCopy:`Ultra-processed-food awareness went mainstream and 'what's in my food' is an everyday creator genre. Yuka proved the demand with 80M users and zero ad spend, but the content layer that feeds it is still creator-owned, not brand-owned.`,heroStatNumber:`16.8M`,heroStatSup:``,heroStatLabel:`plays on a single label-reading TikTok (@avaschumm), the organic demand a scanner app can capture`,heroStatPlatforms:`TIKTOK · REELS · YT SHORTS`},competitive:{tier1Header:`The trust leader`,tier1Brand:`Yuka`,tier1Badge:`80M users`,tier1Desc:`Category-defining scanner, 100% independent, zero ads, ~25K new US users a day. Its score is the niche's trust currency, other brands cite "Rated on Yuka" in their own creatives. Yet its owned social is dormant: 177 TikTok followers, sub-1K-view Shorts.`,tier2Header:`The active spenders`,tier2Brand:`Trash Panda · Fig`,tier2Badge:`Always-on`,tier2Desc:`Trash Panda runs 14 active Meta ads (creatives alive 100–154 days) plus a 23K-follower Instagram. Fig pairs the biggest competitor TikTok (31K followers, 1.1M-play top video) with whitelisted-creator UGC ads for its dietary-restriction niche.`,tier3Header:`The opening`,tier3Brand:`Munchee · PureScan`,tier3Badge:`Now`,tier3Desc:`New scanner apps growing on TikTok purely with UGC-style demos, Munchee took 1.3M likes on a single video. These public engagement counts suggest formats to test; they do not measure signups, purchases, or conversion rates.`},platforms:{tiktok:{brand_headline:`Scanner apps grow on TikTok with <em>UGC, not brand polish.</em>`,brand_intro:`The brand side as it stands: Munchee's UGC demo at 1.3M likes, Fig at 102K, PureScan at 50K, and Yuka's own account at 151 likes. UGC-style demos win, brand polish doesn't.`,brand_videos:[wD(`tt-brand-1`,`@munchee_app`,`1.3M likes`,`UGC APP DEMO`,`https://www.tiktok.com/@munchee_app`),wD(`tt-brand-2`,`@figapp`,`102.4K likes`,`UGC DEMO`,`https://www.tiktok.com/@figapp`),wD(`tt-brand-3`,`@figapp`,`2.2K likes`,`RELATABLE SKIT`,`https://www.tiktok.com/@figapp`),wD(`tt-brand-4`,`@purescan_app`,`50.4K likes`,`UGC HOOK`,`https://www.tiktok.com/@purescan_app`),wD(`tt-brand-5`,`@yukaapp`,`151 likes`,`BRAND POST`,`https://www.tiktok.com/@yukaapp`)],creator_headline:`Label-reading is <em>a daily content genre.</em>`,creator_intro:`POV swaps, additive exposés and grocery lists clear six to seven figures. This audience watches label content daily.`,creator_videos:[wD(`tt-creator-1`,`@avaschumm`,`1.7M likes`,`POV CLEAN SWAP`,`https://www.tiktok.com/@avaschumm`),wD(`tt-creator-2`,`@ttneditz`,`980.2K likes`,`AWARENESS EDIT`,`https://www.tiktok.com/@ttneditz`),wD(`tt-creator-3`,`@holistic.katie`,`568.2K likes`,`TALKING HEAD`,`https://www.tiktok.com/@holistic.katie`),wD(`tt-creator-4`,`@bbc`,`187.6K likes`,`DOC CLIP`,`https://www.tiktok.com/@bbc`),wD(`tt-creator-5`,`@kaylieestewart`,`71.1K likes`,`GROCERY HAUL`,`https://www.tiktok.com/@kaylieestewart`)]},instagram:{brand_headline:`Reels presence is <em>thin, occasional and low-engagement.</em>`,brand_intro:`Search-discovered winners lead: Exposr's expose-style reel at 195K likes and an Olive partner-UGC reel at 45K. The official accounts, Yuka's challenges (634, 284 likes) and Trash Panda's demos, trail far behind.`,brand_videos:[wD(`ig-brand-1`,`@exposr.app`,`195K likes`,`BRAND EXPOSE`,`https://www.instagram.com/exposr.app/`),wD(`ig-brand-2`,`@reallyverycrunchy`,`45K likes`,`PARTNER UGC`,`https://www.instagram.com/reallyverycrunchy/`),wD(`ig-brand-3`,`@yuka_app_us`,`284 likes`,`CHALLENGE`,`https://www.instagram.com/yuka_app_us/`),wD(`ig-brand-4`,`@yuka_app_us`,`634 likes`,`EXPERT EXPLAINER`,`https://www.instagram.com/yuka_app_us/`),wD(`ig-brand-5`,`@trashpanda_app`,`17 likes`,`APP DEMO`,`https://www.instagram.com/trashpanda_app/`)],creator_headline:`Grocery-scanning authority <em>compounds on Reels.</em>`,creator_intro:`Bobby Parrish (3.76M followers) built the 'Bobby Approved' grocery-verdict franchise, 78K–138K views per Reel, then shipped his own scanner app.`,creator_videos:[wD(`ig-creator-1`,`@bobbyparrish`,`137.5K views`,`GROCERY HAUL`,`https://www.instagram.com/bobbyparrish/`),wD(`ig-creator-2`,`@bobbyparrish`,`78.2K views`,`PRODUCT TEST`,`https://www.instagram.com/bobbyparrish/`),wD(`ig-creator-3`,`@bobbyparrish`,`77.9K views`,`SHOPPING VLOG`,`https://www.instagram.com/bobbyparrish/`)]},youtube:{brand_headline:`Competitor Shorts post to <em>hundreds of views.</em>`,brand_intro:`The top scanner-brand Shorts, shown as found: Yuka and Fig peak under 2.5K views, EWG near 1K. No brand has cracked Shorts while creator explainers pull millions.`,brand_videos:[wD(`yt-brand-1`,`@yuka_app`,`1500 views`,`COMPARISON DEMO`,`https://www.youtube.com/@yuka_app`),wD(`yt-brand-2`,`@yuka_app`,`401 views`,`EXPLAINER`,`https://www.youtube.com/@yuka_app`),wD(`yt-brand-3`,`@fig_app`,`1200 views`,`RELATABLE SKIT`,`https://www.youtube.com/@fig_app`),wD(`yt-brand-4`,`@fig_app`,`861 views`,`PRODUCT HAUL`,`https://www.youtube.com/@fig_app`),wD(`yt-brand-5`,`@ewg`,`615 views`,`NEWS BITE`,`https://www.youtube.com/@ewg`)],creator_headline:`Health educators <em>own the demand on Shorts.</em>`,creator_intro:`UPF explainers pull millions (7.1M, 5.4M, 1.5M) and app-review Shorts, including Yuka reviews, sustain six figures.`,creator_videos:[wD(`yt-creator-1`,`@ColleenChristensen`,`7.1M views`,`MINDSET TALKING HEAD`,`https://www.youtube.com/@ColleenChristensen`),wD(`yt-creator-2`,`@richbruckner`,`5.4M views`,`EXPERIMENT`,`https://www.youtube.com/@richbruckner`),wD(`yt-creator-3`,`@DoctorMike`,`1.5M views`,`DOCTOR EXPLAINER`,`https://www.youtube.com/@DoctorMike`),wD(`yt-creator-4`,`@Tommcgeefit`,`1.4M views`,`APP REVIEW`,`https://www.youtube.com/@Tommcgeefit`),wD(`yt-creator-5`,`@MaximumSkin`,`76.8K views`,`APP COMPARISON`,`https://www.youtube.com/@MaximumSkin`)]}},meta_ads:{headline:`Competitors buy the UGC look, and <em>Yuka's score powers everyone's ads.</em>`,intro:`Longevity signals performance: <strong>Trash Panda 100–154 days</strong>, <strong>Fig</strong> ships creator UGC ads. Meanwhile non-competitors pay to say <strong>'Rated 90/100 on Yuka'</strong>, the trust Yuka gives away, others buy.`,ads:[{advertiser:`Trash Panda App`,ad_id:`1`,thumb:CD(`ad-1`)},{advertiser:`Trash Panda App`,ad_id:`2`,thumb:CD(`ad-2`)},{advertiser:`Fig: Food Is Good`,ad_id:`3`,thumb:CD(`ad-3`)},{advertiser:`Recommendations By Liv`,ad_id:`4`,thumb:CD(`ad-4`)},{advertiser:`HygieneLab`,ad_id:`5`,thumb:CD(`ad-5`)},{advertiser:`iota`,ad_id:`6`,thumb:CD(`ad-6`)}]},formats:{formatsHeadline:`Four formats <em>the niche rewards.</em>`,format1Tag:`CONVERSION`,format1Name:`UGC Scan Demo`,format1Desc:`Phone in hand, scan, instant score reveal, the format behind Munchee's 1.3M likes and every Trash Panda ad.`,format2Tag:`SHARE ENGINE`,format2Name:`Label Shock, Then Swap`,format2Desc:`'Read the label, make the swap', 16.8M plays. Yuzli's 0–100 score and swap feature are this format productized.`,format3Tag:`TRUST`,format3Name:`Expert Explainer`,format3Desc:`Doctors and scientists decoding additives, Doctor Mike at 1.5M. Borrowed authority a science-backed app can claim.`,format4Tag:`HABIT`,format4Name:`Grocery Aisle POV`,format4Desc:`Store-walk hauls and verdicts, Bobby Parrish's 3.76M-follower franchise. The natural home for 'scanned with Yuzli' moments.`},strategies:{headline:`Three videos to recreate first`,items:[{title:`The scan-demo format to test`,platform:`tiktok`,format:`UGC APP DEMO`,metric:`1.3M likes`,handle:`@munchee_app`,url:`https://www.tiktok.com/@munchee_app`,thumb:CD(`tt-brand-1`),why_this_video:`1.3M likes on a phone-in-hand scan with an instant score reveal — the exact moment Yuzli's 0–100 score is built for.`,avatar:`one creator, handheld in a grocery aisle`},{title:`Label shock, then the swap`,platform:`tiktok`,format:`POV CLEAN SWAP`,metric:`1.7M likes`,handle:`@avaschumm`,url:`https://www.tiktok.com/@avaschumm`,thumb:CD(`tt-creator-1`),why_this_video:`The label-reading genre's top post: a creator reads what's in the food and swaps it — Yuzli's swap feature is the payoff.`,avatar:`a creator talking to camera in her kitchen`},{title:`Grocery-aisle verdicts`,platform:`instagram`,format:`GROCERY HAUL`,metric:`137.5K views`,handle:`@bobbyparrish`,url:`https://www.instagram.com/bobbyparrish/`,thumb:CD(`ig-creator-1`),why_this_video:`The 'Bobby Approved' franchise proves store-walk verdicts compound — the natural home for 'scanned with Yuzli' moments.`,avatar:`an energetic host walking a store aisle`}]}};function ED(e,t){return t===void 0?`/home/reports/${e}`:`/home/reports/${e}/v/${t}`}var DD=`reddit_listening`,OD=q().trim(),kD=[`reply`,`help`,`skip`],AD=X({name:OD.min(1),capability:OD.min(1),detail:OD.optional()}).passthrough(),jD=X({icp:OD.min(1),useCases:Y(AD).max(12).default([])}).passthrough(),MD=X({id:OD.min(1),url:OD.url(),subreddit:OD,title:OD.min(1),excerpt:OD.default(``),author:OD.default(``),postedAt:OD.nullable().optional(),score:J().default(0),numComments:J().default(0),bucket:Z([`brand`,`competitor`,`need`]),postType:OD.optional(),matched:dw(8),thumb:OD.nullable().optional(),media:Z([`text`,`image`,`gallery`,`crosspost`,`video`,`link`]).default(`text`),verdict:Z(kD),why:OD.default(``),risk:OD.default(``),reply:OD.max(4e3).default(``),changed:bS().optional(),useCase:cw}).passthrough(),ND=X({name:OD.min(1),summary:OD.min(1),tone:Z([`positive`,`mixed`,`negative`,`neutral`]).default(`mixed`),links:Y(X({label:OD.min(1),url:OD.url()})).max(8).default([])}).passthrough(),PD=X({window:Z([`day`,`week`,`month`]),scannedAt:OD,stats:X({scannedPosts:J().int().nonnegative(),candidates:J().int().nonnegative(),brand:J().int().nonnegative().default(0),competitor:J().int().no