ar(--campaign-dc-accent) 5%, transparent)`},children:e.adant}),[e.agency,e.diy].map((t,n)=>(0,A.jsx)(`div`,{style:{padding:`16px 12px`,borderBottom:`1px solid var(--campaign-line-faint)`,textAlign:`center`,fontSize:13,color:`var(--campaign-ash)`},children:t},`${e.k}-${n===0?`agency`:`diy`}`))]},e.k))]})]})}),(0,A.jsx)(cp,{delay:.1,children:(0,A.jsx)(QO,{})})]})})}var ek=`var(--font-campaign)`,tk=`var(--font-display)`;function nk(){return[{q:`What is AdAnt?`,a:`Your AI social marketing team in one chat: agents that research what wins in your niche, recreate any video for your product, find threads worth joining on X and Reddit, and schedule and publish your posts. They work on their own, not only when you ask.`},{q:`Is AdAnt just a video generator?`,a:`No. AdAnt is a team of proactive agents, and videos are only one of their jobs. The Strategist researches your niche, the Analyst listens on X and Reddit, the Manager schedules the other agents and publishes your posts, and the Creator makes the videos. Any of them can run on a schedule and report back when the work is done.`},{q:`What does the Strategist research?`,a:`Give it your product URL. It researches TikTok, Instagram, YouTube and Meta Ads, focused on the top creators and competitors in your niche, and saves a sourced strategy report: the hooks, the formats and the next videos to make.`},{q:`How does the Creator recreate a video from a link?`,a:`Paste a TikTok, Reel, Short or ad URL. It breaks the video down shot by shot (framing, camera moves, light, hook, pacing and script) and remakes it for your product, one take or a batch of variants. No prompt engineering.`},{q:`What does social listening find?`,a:`The Analyst watches X and Reddit for your brand, your competitors and the questions your product answers, ranks the threads worth joining, and drafts a reply in your voice. It never posts for you: you pick the reply and post it.`},{q:`Can the agents work on a schedule and post for me?`,a:`Yes. Put any agent on a schedule, like a weekly research run, daily ideas or a morning listening sweep, and it works without being asked. Connect TikTok and Instagram and the Manager writes captions, picks the times and publishes on schedule (Pro; account connection is in beta).`},{q:`Can I start from my website or product link?`,a:`Yes. Share the link and the agents build on your product: a research report first, or straight to videos.`},{q:`Can I reference my assets with @?`,a:`Yes. Mention your products, avatars, templates and saved strategies with @ and the agent uses them.`},{q:`Can I use AdAnt inside ChatGPT or Codex?`,a:`Yes. The free AdAnt plugin brings the same agents into ChatGPT and Codex, with a confirmation before anything spends credits.`},{q:`What does it cost?`,a:`Start free with ${Math.round(ot(st(new Date)))} credits. Standard is ${xr(it.STANDARD_MONTHLY)}/month for 60 credits a month, Pro is ${xr(it.PRO_MONTHLY)}/month for 150 (${br(it.PRO_YEARLY)}/month billed yearly), and Max scales to ${at.max_4000.credits.toLocaleString(`en-US`)}. Cancel anytime.`}]}function rk(){return(0,A.jsx)(`svg`,{className:`lp-faq-chevron`,width:`18`,height:`18`,viewBox:`0 0 24 24`,fill:`none`,stroke:`currentColor`,strokeWidth:`2`,strokeLinecap:`round`,strokeLinejoin:`round`,"aria-hidden":`true`,children:(0,A.jsx)(`path`,{d:`m6 9 6 6 6-6`})})}function ik(){return(0,A.jsx)(`section`,{"data-section":`faq`,className:`lp-section-faq`,style:{position:`relative`,zIndex:2,background:`var(--campaign-section)`,padding:`120px 32px`},children:(0,A.jsxs)(`div`,{style:{maxWidth:1120,margin:`0 auto`},children:[(0,A.jsx)(If,{chapter:Ut.faq}),(0,A.jsxs)(`div`,{className:`dc-faq-grid`,children:[(0,A.jsx)(`div`,{children:(0,A.jsx)(`h2`,{style:{fontFamily:tk,fontWeight:400,fontSize:`clamp(36px, 4.6vw, 52px)`,lineHeight:1.1,letterSpacing:`-0.01em`,color:`var(--campaign-ink)`,margin:0},children:`Questions, answered.`})}),(0,A.jsx)(`div`,{children:(0,A.jsx)(`div`,{style:{borderTop:`1px solid var(--campaign-line)`