e threads`,`worth joining`],sub:`The Analyst watches X and Reddit for your brand, your competitors and the questions your product answers, ranks what deserves a reply, and drafts one in your voice for you to post.`,proofs:[`X and Reddit, on watch`,`Ranked by intent, not noise`,`Drafted replies you approve`]}],yj={brand:`yuzli.com`,niche:`Food scanner apps`,platforms:[{id:`tiktok`,name:`TikTok`},{id:`instagram`,name:`Instagram`},{id:`youtube`,name:`YouTube`},{id:`meta-ads`,name:`Meta Ads`}],finds:[{platform:`tiktok`,who:`@aisle.truths`,kind:`Top creator`,stat:`2.4M views`},{platform:`meta-ads`,who:`LabelLens`,kind:`Competitor ad`,stat:`Running 41 days`},{platform:`instagram`,who:`@macro.maya`,kind:`Top creator`,stat:`880K views`},{platform:`youtube`,who:`@cleaneats.lab`,kind:`Top creator`,stat:`1.1M views`}],report:`Report ready · 41 references · 3 strategies`},bj={url:`tiktok.com/@aisle.truths/video/7421…`,thumb:`tpl-aisle-pov.webp`,analyzing:`Breaking it down`,shots:[{t:`0:00`,name:`Hook`,frame:`Close-up`},{t:`0:02`,name:`Reveal`,frame:`Medium`},{t:`0:06`,name:`Proof`,frame:`Insert`},{t:`0:11`,name:`Ask`,frame:`Close-up`}],notes:[{k:`Lens`,v:`24mm phone, eye level`},{k:`Light`,v:`Store fluorescents, cool`},{k:`Camera`,v:`Handheld walk, push-in`},{k:`Text`,v:`White caption, top third`},{k:`Pacing`,v:`11 cuts in 14s`}],remake:`Remake for @yuzli with @maya`,noPrompt:`No prompt written`},xj={postingNote:`Posts publish on their own, at the best times · Pro, beta`,days:[`Mon`,`Tue`,`Wed`,`Thu`,`Fri`,`Sat`,`Sun`],jobs:[{day:0,row:0,ant:`content-strategist`,label:`Weekly research`,time:`9:00`},{day:0,row:2,ant:`social-analyst`,label:`Listening sweep`,time:`Daily`},{day:1,row:1,ant:`video-creator`,label:`6 new variants`,time:`11:00`},{day:2,row:2,ant:`social-manager`,label:`Post`,platform:`tiktok`,time:`18:30`},{day:3,row:0,ant:`video-creator`,label:`Daily ideas`,time:`8:00`},{day:4,row:1,ant:`social-manager`,label:`Post`,platform:`instagram`,time:`12:15`},{day:5,row:2,ant: